<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40802" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-fingo</span></b> , ĕre,
			v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make again</i>, <i>make anew</i>
			(very rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: rem, Pac. ap. <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 7, § 91</span></i>
			Müll. (Trag. Rel. p. 108 Rib.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cerea regna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 202</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to feign</i>, <i>pretend</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laetiorem me refingens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M 3, p. 134, 24</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
